        "parms": "1. Click 100 to store a velocity, then 60: noteon 0 sends a note-on for middle C on channel 1, and midiout plays it. Click 64 for an E. Click 0, then 60 and 64 again: a note-on with velocity 0 releases the note on most devices.",
